    "title": "Village Preps for Annual Tampico Days July 16-19 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago Village business was brief at the Tampico Board of Commissioners meeting on Tuesday, July 7th, with the council adjourning after eight minutes. Superintendent Tyler Chriest and crew have been mowing and staining the gazebo at Lions Club Park to try to get everything looking nice before Tampico Days July 16-19. Chriest has everything lined up with Prophetstown to borrow barricades for that weekend and coming over with their street sweeper. The schedule of events is included below: Read full article",
